---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <img class="hero-media" src="/images/web/product-parts.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" eleventy:widths="640,960,1440,1920" sizes="100vw">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">CUSTOM INDUSTRIAL MACHINE KNIVES / 01</span>
        <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}Custom industrial machine knives{% else %}工业机械刀具<br>定制制造{% endif %}</h1>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Custom machine knives for woodworking, food processing, plastics recycling, paper converting, textile and special-purpose equipment. Manufacturing routes are reviewed from drawings, samples and operating requirements and may include material selection, heat treatment, precision machining, grinding and inspection.{% else %}面向木工、食品加工、塑料回收、纸品加工、纺织服装及专用设备领域，依据图纸、样品或工况要求，提供材料评估、热处理、精密加工、研磨、检测及批量制造服务。{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/#rfq-form">{% if lang == "en" %}Submit an RFQ{% else %}提交技术询价{% endif %}</a>
          <a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/products/">{% if lang == "en" %}View products{% else %}查看产品目录{% endif %}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="hero-index" aria-label="{% if lang == 'en' %}RFQ entry paths{% else %}询价入口{% endif %}">
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=drawing#rfq-form"><b>01</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Drawing-based manufacture{% else %}按图制造{% endif %}</span></a>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=sample#rfq-form"><b>02</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Sample replication{% else %}按样复刻{% endif %}</span></a>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=application#rfq-form"><b>03</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Application review{% else %}工况评估{% endif %}</span></a>
        <a href="{{ prefix }}/quality/"><b>04</b><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Batch control{% else %}批次控制{% endif %}</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-strip" aria-label="{% if lang == 'en' %}Manufacturing facts{% else %}制造事实{% endif %}">
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>40+</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Years of group cutting-tool experience{% else %}集团刀具行业经验{% endif %}</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>1990</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Shenzhen production base established{% else %}深圳生产基地成立{% endif %}</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>ISO</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}9001:2015 quality system{% else %}9001:2015 质量体系{% endif %}</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item"><strong>3</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Technical review entry paths{% else %}技术评估资料入口{% endif %}</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DIRECTORY</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Industrial machine knives by application{% else %}工业机械刀具产品分类{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Product categories are organized by industry, equipment and typical application, with the technical information required for manufacturing review.{% else %}产品按行业、设备与典型应用分类，并列明制造评估所需的技术资料。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-grid">
        {% for product in catalog.products %}
          {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="section-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ prefix }}/products/">{% if lang == "en" %}View all products{% else %}查看全部产品{% endif %}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">RFQ ENTRY PATHS</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Technical inputs for RFQ review{% else %}技术评估资料入口{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Manufacturing review can begin from a complete drawing, a physical sample, clear photographs or documented machine and operating conditions.{% else %}可依据完整图纸、实物样品、清晰照片或设备与工况资料启动制造评估。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="route-grid">
        <a class="route-item" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=drawing#rfq-form"><span class="route-number">01 / DRAWING</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Drawing-based manufacture{% else %}按图制造{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Dimensions, tolerances, material, quantity and drawing revision form the basis of quotation and process review.{% else %}尺寸、公差、材料、数量及图纸版本构成报价和工艺评估的基础资料。{% endif %}</p></a>
        <a class="route-item" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=sample#rfq-form"><span class="route-number">02 / SAMPLE</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Sample replication{% else %}按样复刻{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Physical samples, old blades or clear photographs support review of mounting interfaces, edge geometry and failure conditions.{% else %}实物样品、旧刀或清晰照片可用于核对安装接口、刃口几何及失效情况。{% endif %}</p></a>
        <a class="route-item" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=application#rfq-form"><span class="route-number">03 / APPLICATION</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Application review{% else %}工况评估{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}The manufacturing route is reviewed against the machine, processed material, operating frequency and target service life.{% else %}制造工艺依据设备、被处理材料、使用频率及预期使用寿命进行评估。{% endif %}</p></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-system">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING SYSTEM</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Manufacturing processes and quality controls{% else %}制造工艺与质量控制{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Material review, blade shaping, heat treatment, machining, precision grinding and inspection are configured according to blade geometry and acceptance requirements.{% else %}材料评估、刀坯成形、热处理、机加工、精密研磨与检测，依据刀具结构和验收要求形成相应工艺路线。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="system-panel">
        <div class="system-rows">
          {% for capability in catalog.capabilities %}
          <div class="system-row"><strong>{{ capability.code }}</strong><p>{{ capability.summary[lang] }}</p><a href="{{ prefix }}/capabilities/{{ capability.slug }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}OPEN{% else %}查看{% endif %}</a></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="system-media"><img src="/images/web/product-parts.jpg" alt="{% if lang == 'en' %}Finished industrial blade components{% else %}工业刀具成品零件{% endif %}" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="640,960,1440" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 44vw, 100vw"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">QUALITY CONTROL</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Quality control throughout manufacturing{% else %}制造全过程质量控制{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Material analysis, coordinate measurement, image measurement and metallography support applicable material, dimensional and process inspections.{% else %}材料分析、三坐标测量、影像尺寸测量与金相检验，为相应的材料、尺寸和过程检验提供支持。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="quality-preview">
        <figure><img src="/images/quality/spectrolab-spectrometer.jpeg" alt="SPECTROLAB spectrometer" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="360,720" sizes="(min-width: 1080px) 32vw, (min-width: 600px) 48vw, 100vw"><figcaption>{% if lang == "en" %}SPECTROLAB spectrometer / material analysis{% else %}SPECTROLAB 光谱仪 / 材料分析{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/quality/cmm-beyond-apex707.jpeg" alt="Mitutoyo BEYOND APEX 707 CMM" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="360,720" sizes="(min-width: 1080px) 32vw, (min-width: 600px) 48vw, 100vw"><figcaption>{% if lang == "en" %}Mitutoyo BEYOND APEX 707 / dimensional inspection{% else %}三丰 BEYOND APEX 707 / 尺寸检测{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/quality/keyence-im7000.jpeg" alt="KEYENCE IM-7000 image measurement system" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="360,720" sizes="(min-width: 1080px) 32vw, (min-width: 600px) 48vw, 100vw"><figcaption>{% if lang == "en" %}KEYENCE IM-7000 / image dimension measurement{% else %}基恩士 IM-7000 / 影像尺寸测量{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="quality-points">
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>ISO 9001:2015</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Quality management system{% else %}质量管理体系{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Material verification{% else %}材料确认{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Material route reviewed against technical and application requirements{% else %}依据技术与应用要求确认材料路线{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Dimensional inspection{% else %}尺寸检测{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Mounting dimensions and geometry checked against drawings{% else %}按图纸检查安装尺寸与几何要求{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="quality-point"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Batch records{% else %}批次记录{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Inspection and batch information retained where applicable{% else %}按适用要求保留检验与批次信息{% endif %}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/quality/">{% if lang == "en" %}Review the quality system{% else %}查看质量体系{% endif %}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="factory-band">
    <img class="factory-media" src="/images/web/factory-building.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="640,960,1440,1920" sizes="100vw">
    <div class="container factory-band-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">MODERN FACTORY / GROUP BACKGROUND</span>
      <h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Group manufacturing experience and the Zhangzhou production base{% else %}集团制造体系与漳州生产基地{% endif %}</h2>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Qunxin Industrial was established in Zhangzhou in 2024 as a member of Wei Qun Cutting Tools Group, continuing the group’s experience in industrial knives and cutting tools.{% else %}群新工业（漳州）有限公司成立于 2024 年，是伟群制刀工业集团成员企业，延续集团在工业刀具与切削工具领域的制造经验。{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="factory-facts">
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>40+</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Years of group background{% else %}集团行业背景{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>1990</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Shenzhen base established{% else %}深圳基地成立{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>2024</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Zhangzhou Qunxin established{% else %}漳州群新成立{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="factory-fact"><strong>ISO</strong><span>9001:2015</span></div>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/company/">{% if lang == "en" %}View company profile{% else %}查看公司概况{% endif %}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER REFERENCES</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Brand and equipment application references{% else %}合作品牌与设备应用参考{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Relevant projects cover multiple blade families, equipment brands and industrial applications for brand owners, equipment manufacturers and industrial users.{% else %}相关项目覆盖多类刀具、设备品牌与工业应用，合作对象包括品牌企业、设备制造商及工业用户。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="logo-wall">
        {% for logo in ["kam", "eastman", "sata", "stanley", "baird-medical", "tti", "jwei", "lectra", "bullmer", "fiskars"] %}
        <div class="logo-item"><img src="/images/logos/{{ logo }}.png" alt="{{ logo }} logo" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="120,240" sizes="160px"></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
